[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2134.79, "timestamp": "00:35:34", "text": "適用於 YouTube。好的，對於 Twitch 來說，呃，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2139.109, "timestamp": "00:35:39", "text": "想你可以屏蔽或忽略。等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2142.31, "timestamp": "00:35:42", "text": "忽略它才是最好的方法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2144.47, "timestamp": "00:35:44", "text": "無視是最好的。我認為你可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2147.19, "timestamp": "00:35:47", "text": "是的，你可以在 YouTube 上封鎖和舉報，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2150.79, "timestamp": "00:35:50", "text": "但在 Twitch 上不行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2152.95, "timestamp": "00:35:52", "text": "如果版主發現任何不良"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2156.79, "timestamp": "00:35:56", "text": "內容或我本人的行為，我也會將"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2159.19, "timestamp": "00:35:59", "text": "其刪除。"}]